sequenceDiagram
    %% @mermaid-chart
    actor U as User
    participant FE as WebApp (Next.js)
    participant BA as BetterAuth
    participant IG as Instagram Graph API
    participant EP as EPUB Builder (server)
    U->>FE: Open app
    U->>FE: Click Instagram SSO
    FE->>BA: Start OAuth dance
    BA-->>FE: Encrypted session & access token cookies
    FE-->>U: Logged-in session
    FE->>IG: GET /me/media (via /api/instagram/hashtags)
    IG-->>FE: Recent posts for hashtag aggregation
    FE-->>U: Show <datalist> & quick-select hashtag chips
    U->>FE: Select hashtag chip or type hashtag & set date range
    FE->>IG: Fetch feed with filters (/api/instagram/media)
    IG-->>FE: Filtered posts
    FE-->>U: Show post selection & book settings
    U->>FE: Enter title/author/contact/IG URL & request EPUB
    FE->>EP: Build EPUB with metadata+images (/api/epub)
    EP-->>FE: EPUB binary (Blob)
    FE-->>U: Trigger download (EPUB)
    U->>FE: Logout or 退会（連携解除）を実行
    FE-->>U: Better Auth Cookie を削除して未ログイン状態へ戻す
